---
// Post 9 figure (margin trading): SbP09CallTimeline
---
<figure class="sbp9-call">
  <div class="scroll">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 900 335" role="img" aria-label="Timeline: after the ratio drops under 35%, MBS 2025 sends five notices over five consecutive trading days and sells on the fifth; Decision 87 of 2017 caps the top-up window at three working days; reaching 30% means a sale the day the notice arrives.">
      <text x="20" y="28" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>What happens after the ratio drops under 35% (two documents, two clocks)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Điều gì xảy ra sau khi tỷ lệ xuống dưới 35% (hai văn bản, hai đồng hồ)</tspan></text><circle cx="150" cy="105" r="22" class="dotg"/><text x="150" y="110" class="b wh" text-anchor="middle">1</text><text x="150" y="150" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Notice 1</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Thông báo 1</tspan></text><text x="150" y="166" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>day 1</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>ngày 1</tspan></text><line x1="174" y1="105" x2="253" y2="105" class="ln"/><polygon points="261,105 252,100 252,110" class="ah"/><circle cx="285" cy="105" r="22" class="dotg"/><text x="285" y="110" class="b wh" text-anchor="middle">2</text><text x="285" y="150" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Notice 2</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Thông báo 2</tspan></text><text x="285" y="166" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>day 2</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>ngày 2</tspan></text><line x1="309" y1="105" x2="388" y2="105" class="ln"/><polygon points="396,105 387,100 387,110" class="ah"/><circle cx="420" cy="105" r="22" class="dotg"/><text x="420" y="110" class="b wh" text-anchor="middle">3</text><text x="420" y="150" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Notice 3</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Thông báo 3</tspan></text><text x="420" y="166" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>day 3</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>ngày 3</tspan></text><line x1="444" y1="105" x2="523" y2="105" class="ln"/><polygon points="531,105 522,100 522,110" class="ah"/><circle cx="555" cy="105" r="22" class="dotg"/><text x="555" y="110" class="b wh" text-anchor="middle">4</text><text x="555" y="150" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Notice 4</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Thông báo 4</tspan></text><text x="555" y="166" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>day 4</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>ngày 4</tspan></text><line x1="579" y1="105" x2="658" y2="105" class="ln"/><polygon points="666,105 657,100 657,110" class="ah"/><circle cx="690" cy="105" r="22" class="dotr"/><text x="690" y="110" class="b wh" text-anchor="middle">S</text><text x="690" y="150" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Sale</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bán</tspan></text><text x="690" y="166" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>day 5</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>ngày 5</tspan></text><path d="M 128 186 L 128 196 L 712 196 L 712 186" class="ln"/><text x="420" y="214" class="b" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>MBS policy 2025: five notices in five consecutive trading days, sale on the fifth</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Chính sách MBS 2025: năm thông báo trong năm ngày giao dịch liên tiếp, bán vào ngày thứ năm</tspan></text><path d="M 128 232 L 128 242 L 442 242 L 442 232" class="lng"/><text x="128" y="262" class="g"><tspan data-lang-en>Decision 87 (2017), Art. 7: top-up time set by the broker, at most 3 working days</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Quyết định 87 (2017), Điều 7: thời hạn bổ sung do công ty chứng khoán đặt, tối đa 3 ngày làm việc</tspan></text><rect x="20" y="280" width="860" height="38" rx="8" class="boxr"/><text x="34" y="304" class="r"><tspan data-lang-en>If the ratio reaches 30% (force-sell line): sold the day the notice arrives, no waiting days.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Nếu tỷ lệ chạm 30% (đường bán giải chấp): bán ngay trong ngày nhận thông báo, không có ngày chờ.</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The two clocks do not match on their face. The contract you signed says which one applies to you.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Hai đồng hồ không khớp nhau nếu chỉ nhìn văn bản. Hợp đồng bạn ký nói cái nào áp dụng cho bạn.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

